        "content": "<p>The lemmas we already have seem to be <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Set.Icc_mul_Icc_subset%27#doc\">docs#Set.Icc_mul_Icc_subset'</a> and <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Set.Icc_mul_Icc#doc\">docs#Set.Icc_mul_Icc</a>, so the answer to 5 is definitely that pointwise multiplication is preferred.</p>",
